(113960, 5047, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good photo, questionable candid shot.  Seems like the lower part of the face isn''t quite in focus, could be movement....  Good color.  Interesting framing, but I wish you hadn''t cut her off at the forehead.  8 Swash</td>', 'Good photo, questionable candid shot.  Seems like the lower part of the face isn''t quite in focus, could be movement....  Good color.  Interesting framing, but I wish you hadn''t cut her off at the forehead.  8 Swash', '2002-09-06 20:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
