(113962, 5051, 1827, '<td valign="top">This photo seems like it could be improved by reducing the green channel only in your editing software.  The hair and skin of the players seem to be too green.  Perhaps you did it on purpose, if so, it doesn''t work for me personally.  A differnt cropping might have worked better.  The crowd on the left seems cluttered, which might not matter so much except that your focal point (#31) is looking that way, which makes me want to look that way to see what he sees.  Without the people there, I''d assume the ball was maybe coming his way.  Hope this helps. 4, just-married</td>', 'This photo seems like it could be improved by reducing the green channel only in your editing software.  The hair and skin of the players seem to be too green.  Perhaps you did it on purpose, if so, it doesn''t work for me personally.  A differnt cropping might have worked better.  The crowd on the left seems cluttered, which might not matter so much except that your focal point (#31) is looking that way, which makes me want to look that way to see what he sees.  Without the people there, I''d assume the ball was maybe coming his way.  Hope this helps. 4, just-married', '2002-09-02 22:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
