(114037, 5066, 1037, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this photo! It stood out from the thumbnails early on, and was the first one I looked at. Ordinarily that effect would make me give it a 10 straight away, I don''t know why I waited :). It''s so stark and contorted, the black and white is beautiful, I love that huge tongue under the white teeth and the flaring nostrils :). Well, it''s taken a few days, but here''s your 10 - lisae</td>', 'I LOVE this photo! It stood out from the thumbnails early on, and was the first one I looked at. Ordinarily that effect would make me give it a 10 straight away, I don''t know why I waited :). It''s so stark and contorted, the black and white is beautiful, I love that huge tongue under the white teeth and the flaring nostrils :). Well, it''s taken a few days, but here''s your 10 - lisae', '2002-09-04 16:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
