(114054, 5069, 2829, '<td valign="top">I am guessing you tried to meet the "Try to emphasize the mood of the moment" of the challenge and I do know what happens when you put salt on a slug. However, I do not think most of the viewers on dpc can make a similar association. I could see this image working if you had zoomed out a little more, had it slightly more in focus and had a slow shutter speed to show the slug twitching and squirming after the salt is placed.</td>', 'I am guessing you tried to meet the "Try to emphasize the mood of the moment" of the challenge and I do know what happens when you put salt on a slug. However, I do not think most of the viewers on dpc can make a similar association. I could see this image working if you had zoomed out a little more, had it slightly more in focus and had a slow shutter speed to show the slug twitching and squirming after the salt is placed.', '2002-09-04 10:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
