(114086, 5071, 889, '<td valign="top">good choice of angles and rules of thirds  another one of the few B&amp;W that are ok as B&amp;W because of the large contrastings colors.</td>', 'good choice of angles and rules of thirds  another one of the few B&W that are ok as B&W because of the large contrastings colors.', '2002-09-03 20:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114087, 5071, 3641, '<td valign="top">err, lil closer, lil sharper?? but there''s a FEEL.</td>', 'err, lil closer, lil sharper?? but there''s a FEEL.', '2002-09-04 05:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114088, 5071, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the "empty" feeling of this pic.  The bw and stark contrast really set a mood, and the subject is so small in the frame, that it seems to make a comment about his significance.  Does that make sense?  I like it. karmat</td>', 'I like the "empty" feeling of this pic.  The bw and stark contrast really set a mood, and the subject is so small in the frame, that it seems to make a comment about his significance.  Does that make sense?  I like it. karmat', '2002-09-04 15:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114089, 5071, 255, '<td valign="top">wow, beautiful. this is a very thought provoking and interesting picture. i would like it even better if it were zoomed in just a *tad* closer to give the guy a little more of the spotlight, but otherwise i really like the framing and composition---and i am a sucker for black and white photos like this! 9--amitchell</td>', 'wow, beautiful. this is a very thought provoking and interesting picture. i would like it even better if it were zoomed in just a *tad* closer to give the guy a little more of the spotlight, but otherwise i really like the framing and composition---and i am a sucker for black and white photos like this! 9--amitchell', '2002-09-04 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114090, 5071, 637, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but the subject is too small a part of this image.  4 sjgleah</td>', 'Interesting, but the subject is too small a part of this image.  4 sjgleah', '2002-09-05 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114091, 5071, 3469, '<td valign="top">Where in Sydney? What happened to the colors? Is this reaaly a person?</td>', 'Where in Sydney? What happened to the colors? Is this reaaly a person?', '2002-09-05 18:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114092, 5071, 1005, '<td valign="top">Kinda dark, don''t you think?  If it weren''t for the light coloroed breakwater, I would have missed the sleeper (less than distinct in this photo).  7 Swash</td>', 'Kinda dark, don''t you think?  If it weren''t for the light coloroed breakwater, I would have missed the sleeper (less than distinct in this photo).  7 Swash', '2002-09-06 20:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114093, 5071, 1037, '<td valign="top">As an Australian, this photo has a deep impact on me (although the typo in the title is annoying!). I''ve walked around Sydney many times and this sight is very familiar. The black and white captures the grittiness of this scene beautifully. Well done. (lisae)</td>', 'As an Australian, this photo has a deep impact on me (although the typo in the title is annoying!). I''ve walked around Sydney many times and this sight is very familiar. The black and white captures the grittiness of this scene beautifully. Well done. (lisae)', '2002-09-08 01:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
