(114296, 5095, 3185, '<td valign="top">Good motion here.  As I look at it, I am almost worried that they are going to throw the balls so fast and hard that it will break through the back wall!  (I guess it really is the "express lane"!</td>', 'Good motion here.  As I look at it, I am almost worried that they are going to throw the balls so fast and hard that it will break through the back wall!  (I guess it really is the "express lane"!', '2002-09-05 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
