(114300, 5095, 2667, '<td valign="top">neat shot. i can''t even see the bowling balls. (7)  ~mcmurma</td>', 'neat shot. i can''t even see the bowling balls. (7)  ~mcmurma', '2002-09-08 02:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114301, 5095, 2798, '<td valign="top">Lovely motion captured here. A great photo opportunity well caught.</td>', 'Lovely motion captured here. A great photo opportunity well caught.', '2002-09-08 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114302, 5096, 1826, '<td valign="top">Funny. :)</td>', 'Funny. :)', '2002-09-02 06:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114303, 5096, 2353, '<td valign="top">This picture literally made me laugh out loud!  It is very humorous and well composed.  It also most definately meets the challenge as being candid.  I think that going b&amp;w on this was a good choice.  My only critique is that you may want to play with the cropping on it a little.  The extra white wall on the top and left wall leaves something for me.  Great job!!!! 9 -KrazyKat</td>', 'This picture literally made me laugh out loud!  It is very humorous and well composed.  It also most definately meets the challenge as being candid.  I think that going b&w on this was a good choice.  My only critique is that you may want to play with the cropping on it a little.  The extra white wall on the top and left wall leaves something for me.  Great job!!!! 9 -KrazyKat', '2002-09-02 11:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114304, 5096, 327, '<td valign="top">Good composition, although it would of been good to see the _cats_ face. Still I love this, love the b&amp;w. The focus is just too soft in this light. Nice job all the same.<br/>Score 7 Justine.</td>', 'Good composition, although it would of been good to see the _cats_ face. Still I love this, love the b&w. The focus is just too soft in this light. Nice job all the same.Score 7 Justine.', '2002-09-02 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114305, 5096, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting candid :)  I think the flash has created some harsh light... - jmsetzler</td>', 'interesting candid :)  I think the flash has created some harsh light... - jmsetzler', '2002-09-02 14:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114306, 5096, 2223, '<td valign="top">thats cute, nice candid.</td>', 'thats cute, nice candid.', '2002-09-02 15:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
