(114308, 5096, 3102, '<td valign="top">Before the challenge I would have probably said that any pet photo wouldn''t live up to the "candid" challenge, but I think this one does.  Very cute shot -- I only wish we could see a little more of the cat''s face.</td>', 'Before the challenge I would have probably said that any pet photo wouldn''t live up to the "candid" challenge, but I think this one does.  Very cute shot -- I only wish we could see a little more of the cat''s face.', '2002-09-02 22:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114309, 5096, 2932, '<td valign="top">mood captured - a cat recognizing its likeness<br/>sincerity of expressions - fabulous</td>', 'mood captured - a cat recognizing its likenesssincerity of expressions - fabulous', '2002-09-02 23:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114310, 5096, 51167, '<td valign="top">My mom has that picture frame.</td>', 'My mom has that picture frame.', '2002-09-03 00:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114311, 5096, 889, '<td valign="top">cat candid is hard, they dont startle well.</td>', 'cat candid is hard, they dont startle well.', '2002-09-03 00:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114312, 5096, 2204, '<td valign="top">The only candid animal photo I see..........I think it would be more difficult to get a candid aminal photo than it has been to get candid people shots, and that was darn difficult!!!  =5 syamjonimi  ;''-D  <br/>The dark shadow behind the cats face makes it difficult to determine what is shadow and what is the facial line.  Also the darks in the picture are too dark or too intense making my eye want to look into the dark areas rather than the subject and feeling of the photo.  Guess what I am trying to say is - The lighting could be better, for me.</td>', 'The only candid animal photo I see..........I think it would be more difficult to get a candid aminal photo than it has been to get candid people shots, and that was darn difficult!!!  =5 syamjonimi  ;''-D  The dark shadow behind the cats face makes it difficult to determine what is shadow and what is the facial line.  Also the darks in the picture are too dark or too intense making my eye want to look into the dark areas rather than the subject and feeling of the photo.  Guess what I am trying to say is - The lighting could be better, for me.', '2002-09-03 02:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
