(114584, 5126, 2673, '<td valign="top">Tks to everyone who saw / voted / commented on this picture.<br/>Yes, the composition is not great mainly because of the people in the background but since this is not a set up picture (and this is what qualifies it as candid) I couldn´t achieve a simpler background. About sjgleah´s comment: from where I was standing it was impossible to show what she was running to (her boyfriend) in the picture but the title is an attempt to fill this gap. Anyway, tks again!</td>', 'Tks to everyone who saw / voted / commented on this picture.Yes, the composition is not great mainly because of the people in the background but since this is not a set up picture (and this is what qualifies it as candid) I couldn´t achieve a simpler background. About sjgleah´s comment: from where I was standing it was impossible to show what she was running to (her boyfriend) in the picture but the title is an attempt to fill this gap. Anyway, tks again!', '2002-09-09 08:51:00.000000', NULL, 0),
