(114586, 5128, 3616, '<td valign="top">I don''t like seeing the backs of people.  Their stories are in their eyes.  I want to see her fear...her reluctance...and it was all there - from the front.<br/>Don''t confuse candid with secretly taken...<br/>Composition is off a bit - what is your subject?  If it is the little girl then why so much competing stuff in the photo?  Get in CLOSE and show me what you''re looking at, give me no option but to see exactly what drew yopu to taking this photo.<br/>5<br/>-11n</td>', 'I don''t like seeing the backs of people.  Their stories are in their eyes.  I want to see her fear...her reluctance...and it was all there - from the front.Don''t confuse candid with secretly taken...Composition is off a bit - what is your subject?  If it is the little girl then why so much competing stuff in the photo?  Get in CLOSE and show me what you''re looking at, give me no option but to see exactly what drew yopu to taking this photo.5-11n', '2002-09-02 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
