(114740, 5137, 3469, '<td valign="top">The picture makes me feel a voyeur, intentionally. She is just herself, she can''t help it that we have to look. Good atmosphere.</td>', 'The picture makes me feel a voyeur, intentionally. She is just herself, she can''t help it that we have to look. Good atmosphere.', '2002-09-04 17:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114741, 5137, 255, '<td valign="top">i dig this--nice mood portrayed here. it is definitely a part of our everyday life. (because of the somewhat monochrome color scheme going on here--just for fun i took the liberty of throwing it in photoshop and changing it to black and white with a little grain-- and liked that too, because the windows give a cool overblown effect there as well.) anyway, nice framing and composition on this one and i also like the subtle motion blur. 8--amitchell</td>', 'i dig this--nice mood portrayed here. it is definitely a part of our everyday life. (because of the somewhat monochrome color scheme going on here--just for fun i took the liberty of throwing it in photoshop and changing it to black and white with a little grain-- and liked that too, because the windows give a cool overblown effect there as well.) anyway, nice framing and composition on this one and i also like the subtle motion blur. 8--amitchell', '2002-09-04 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
