(114752, 5137, 3080, '<td valign="top">Bravo Lisa!!  Sorry I didn''t get to comment earlier, I''ve been really sick and then out of town for the weekend.  I admire this, and even more since it''s a self portrait!  ~Heather~</td>', 'Bravo Lisa!!  Sorry I didn''t get to comment earlier, I''ve been really sick and then out of town for the weekend.  I admire this, and even more since it''s a self portrait!  ~Heather~', '2002-09-09 01:21:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(114753, 5137, 1897, '<td valign="top">Knowing that this is a self portrait changes things a bit.  This is definitely a slice of life.  I am sorry some were so rude and short sighted as they are.  It is nice to see you can share so openly.</td>', 'Knowing that this is a self portrait changes things a bit.  This is definitely a slice of life.  I am sorry some were so rude and short sighted as they are.  It is nice to see you can share so openly.', '2002-09-09 01:23:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(114754, 5137, 1037, '<td valign="top">I''m OK with all the comments, I guess I expected them. It''s interesting that people think women will always get angry if someone takes an "unflattering" photo of them! I think that''s actually what I really wanted to play with here, because the topic of "candid" is all about stripping away the artifice and getting to reality, and this kind of photo is as real as it can get for a woman. I got what I wanted, so I''m happy :)<br/><br/>As for people thinking I''m fat... well, I''m a short, top-heavy person and if you only see the top half I think it does make me seem larger than I am :). I''m not thin, that''s for sure, but I like my body.</td>', 'I''m OK with all the comments, I guess I expected them. It''s interesting that people think women will always get angry if someone takes an "unflattering" photo of them! I think that''s actually what I really wanted to play with here, because the topic of "candid" is all about stripping away the artifice and getting to reality, and this kind of photo is as real as it can get for a woman. I got what I wanted, so I''m happy :)As for people thinking I''m fat... well, I''m a short, top-heavy person and if you only see the top half I think it does make me seem larger than I am :). I''m not thin, that''s for sure, but I like my body.', '2002-09-09 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(114755, 5137, 1863, '<td valign="top">I love your boobs! NIPPLE!<br/>-Annida<br/><br/>Actually, I''ve met lisae, and she''s not fat at all. People thinking she''s fat in any way are short sighted and rather sad. She even belly danced for me! oooh baby!</td>', 'I love your boobs! NIPPLE!-AnnidaActually, I''ve met lisae, and she''s not fat at all. People thinking she''s fat in any way are short sighted and rather sad. She even belly danced for me! oooh baby!', '2002-09-09 03:15:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(114756, 5137, 2170, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why, and I really refrained from saying anything this week, but I was just positive this was your photo, Lisae.  Isn''t it wierd the way intuition works?  I just KNEW it was you....never met you, never spoken to you, never had any contact with you outside of dp.  Bizarre!<br/><br/>Oh well, I liked the picture anyway.  People suck!<br/><br/>Rob</td>', 'I don''t know why, and I really refrained from saying anything this week, but I was just positive this was your photo, Lisae.  Isn''t it wierd the way intuition works?  I just KNEW it was you....never met you, never spoken to you, never had any contact with you outside of dp.  Bizarre!Oh well, I liked the picture anyway.  People suck!Rob', '2002-09-09 10:21:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(114757, 5137, 1891, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry you scored so low.  You quite certainly should have gotten a much better vote for this.  The composition of the....anyways, very nice looking, very very nice.  I wish I knew a woman that looked like this.</td>', 'I''m sorry you scored so low.  You quite certainly should have gotten a much better vote for this.  The composition of the....anyways, very nice looking, very very nice.  I wish I knew a woman that looked like this.', '2002-09-09 10:36:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(114758, 5137, 1005, '<td valign="top">Lisae, titled as self portrait, this would have been seen as a bold, artistic move, but as the model/artist roles weren''t clear, I had to question this.  If this were me taking this of my wife, she agreed, my camera would be in pieces.  I think my wife has a wonderful shape, but alas, she does not, so you won''t be seeing this much of her, ever.  I made no comment about your shape, let''s just leave it at "I''d be happy to see you dance for me."  Thanks Annida for this insight.  Titled as "Me after a shower", would have netted you at least a couple extra points from me.  All Smiles.  Rob</td>', 'Lisae, titled as self portrait, this would have been seen as a bold, artistic move, but as the model/artist roles weren''t clear, I had to question this.  If this were me taking this of my wife, she agreed, my camera would be in pieces.  I think my wife has a wonderful shape, but alas, she does not, so you won''t be seeing this much of her, ever.  I made no comment about your shape, let''s just leave it at "I''d be happy to see you dance for me."  Thanks Annida for this insight.  Titled as "Me after a shower", would have netted you at least a couple extra points from me.  All Smiles.  Rob', '2002-09-09 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 0),
