(114824, 5139, 2764, '<td valign="top">Perfect picture. This is my second favorite.  Of course her face is wonderful, but I love to colors too.  that green in the window frame does nice things for her eyes and the brown frames the green wall the way the plaid coat frames her green eyes, nice.  I like the blob on the right too,  It makes me think she''s not all alone and without the abstact pressence of thta person she would be too vulnerable.   I like that the window is white rather than sky colored or treed.  The blank white makes a perfect baance to the dark walls and the dark coat.  Lighting is perfect. 10</td>', 'Perfect picture. This is my second favorite.  Of course her face is wonderful, but I love to colors too.  that green in the window frame does nice things for her eyes and the brown frames the green wall the way the plaid coat frames her green eyes, nice.  I like the blob on the right too,  It makes me think she''s not all alone and without the abstact pressence of thta person she would be too vulnerable.   I like that the window is white rather than sky colored or treed.  The blank white makes a perfect baance to the dark walls and the dark coat.  Lighting is perfect. 10', '2002-09-04 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
