(114897, 5141, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like how the cloud edge parallels your subject''s profile...but then I like things like that!</td>', 'I like how the cloud edge parallels your subject''s profile...but then I like things like that!', '2002-09-08 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114898, 5141, 1325, '<td valign="top">I am surprised that this photo did not get a higher rating.  It is a truely candid shot and well presented.  I gave you an 8 and only then because there was many really great shots in this challenge.</td>', 'I am surprised that this photo did not get a higher rating.  It is a truely candid shot and well presented.  I gave you an 8 and only then because there was many really great shots in this challenge.', '2002-09-09 19:11:00.000000', NULL, 0),
