(115107, 5160, 1005, '<td valign="top">Title/pic well matched!  Good stopped motion (almost stopped both drumsticks)!  <br/>The red-eye is a good touch here.  8 Swash</td>', 'Title/pic well matched!  Good stopped motion (almost stopped both drumsticks)!  The red-eye is a good touch here.  8 Swash', '2002-09-06 19:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
