(115109, 5160, 637, '<td valign="top">I don''t see this as a candid image.   To me, when a person is doing something where he/she knows that spectators are watching, the idea of "candid" goes away.  4 sjgleah</td>', 'I don''t see this as a candid image.   To me, when a person is doing something where he/she knows that spectators are watching, the idea of "candid" goes away.  4 sjgleah', '2002-09-07 01:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
