(115111, 5160, 1827, '<td valign="top">Yikes.  I don''t wanna meet this guy in a back alley.  Aptly titled.  Nice composition.  The orange of the drums against the purple background is nice too.  7, just-married</td>', 'Yikes.  I don''t wanna meet this guy in a back alley.  Aptly titled.  Nice composition.  The orange of the drums against the purple background is nice too.  7, just-married', '2002-09-08 00:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
