(115116, 5163, 3402, '<td valign="top">I think this is a really great picture.  I do question if it is candid or not.  I guess if you define candid as ''spur of the moment'' or something captured spontanously then this fits the bill.</td>', 'I think this is a really great picture.  I do question if it is candid or not.  I guess if you define candid as ''spur of the moment'' or something captured spontanously then this fits the bill.', '2002-09-02 11:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
