(115309, 5181, 772, '<td valign="top">phenomenal portrait... i have no critique... The black and white as well as the lighting on this image are exceptional... = 10 - jmsetzler</td>', 'phenomenal portrait... i have no critique... The black and white as well as the lighting on this image are exceptional... = 10 - jmsetzler', '2002-09-02 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(115310, 5181, 2353, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  I like how you''ve captured the sweat on his face and although some may disagree, I even like the shadow of the mike against his face.  My only critique is the cropping.  I think that it is too tight on top.  I think that the b&amp;w was a good choice on this as well.  Good job! -KrazyKat</td>', 'I like this a lot.  I like how you''ve captured the sweat on his face and although some may disagree, I even like the shadow of the mike against his face.  My only critique is the cropping.  I think that it is too tight on top.  I think that the b&w was a good choice on this as well.  Good job! -KrazyKat', '2002-09-02 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(115311, 5181, 3313, '<td valign="top">I like the light in the hair and the composition is good. Well done.</td>', 'I like the light in the hair and the composition is good. Well done.', '2002-09-02 17:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
