(115319, 5181, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice black and white shot.  The closest thing to a nit is the glare on the his thoat, but everything else is wonderful.  Great contrast.  9 Swash</td>', 'This is a very nice black and white shot.  The closest thing to a nit is the glare on the his thoat, but everything else is wonderful.  Great contrast.  9 Swash', '2002-09-04 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(115320, 5181, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very good capture of the singer''s expression. The black and white is rich and the lighting is very effective (especially the backlighting on the hair). I especially love the little glisten of sweat on the singer''s neck. It''s an image full of sincerity and depth.</td>', 'Very good capture of the singer''s expression. The black and white is rich and the lighting is very effective (especially the backlighting on the hair). I especially love the little glisten of sweat on the singer''s neck. It''s an image full of sincerity and depth.', '2002-09-04 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(115321, 5181, 255, '<td valign="top">this shot is fabulous. i know how hard band photography is, but you have it down! if i knew this person i would definitely have this framed on my wall---or at least give him a copy! the lighting is wonderful and i really like the angle. 10--amitchell</td>', 'this shot is fabulous. i know how hard band photography is, but you have it down! if i knew this person i would definitely have this framed on my wall---or at least give him a copy! the lighting is wonderful and i really like the angle. 10--amitchell', '2002-09-04 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(115322, 5181, 811, '<td valign="top">Good bw.  I like the angle here, maybe if the subject was a little to the left, it would feel more complete to me, but I suspect that is only a personal thing. karmat</td>', 'Good bw.  I like the angle here, maybe if the subject was a little to the left, it would feel more complete to me, but I suspect that is only a personal thing. karmat', '2002-09-06 14:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
