(115325, 5181, 1827, '<td valign="top">This is one I meant to comment on and missed somehow.  TERRIFIC portrait.  This could be an album cover.  Great job.  No doubt the placement/score would have been higher if the challenge were "Portraits".  I know there were people who may have questioned the candidness of the photo.  Good work anyway.<br/></td>', 'This is one I meant to comment on and missed somehow.  TERRIFIC portrait.  This could be an album cover.  Great job.  No doubt the placement/score would have been higher if the challenge were "Portraits".  I know there were people who may have questioned the candidness of the photo.  Good work anyway.', '2002-09-09 02:11:00.000000', NULL, 0),
