(115328, 5182, 2680, '<td valign="top">It may look better lightened a bit so that the subjects don''t appear so dark and muddled. Contrast adjustment may help also.</td>', 'It may look better lightened a bit so that the subjects don''t appear so dark and muddled. Contrast adjustment may help also.', '2002-09-02 02:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
