(115403, 5184, 3317, '<td valign="top">you get a ten ''cause it''s an original idea plus rule of thirds plus different lighting sources and effects plus it fits the challenge like a glove (and 4 cute kids couldn''t hurt either). way to go. next time you hesitate about should i really take so and so''s candid picture or not forget any inhibitions you may have and shoot your butt off, you obviously know what you''re doing, you''ve made a beautiful thing and the world needs more.</td>', 'you get a ten ''cause it''s an original idea plus rule of thirds plus different lighting sources and effects plus it fits the challenge like a glove (and 4 cute kids couldn''t hurt either). way to go. next time you hesitate about should i really take so and so''s candid picture or not forget any inhibitions you may have and shoot your butt off, you obviously know what you''re doing, you''ve made a beautiful thing and the world needs more.', '2002-09-05 01:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
