(115409, 5184, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! How did you do this - are you looking up at a mirrored ceiling or down through a glass floor? Composition is very interesting, and the images look like a collage of people rather than just a group of people.</td>', 'Nicely done! How did you do this - are you looking up at a mirrored ceiling or down through a glass floor? Composition is very interesting, and the images look like a collage of people rather than just a group of people.', '2002-09-07 02:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
