(115436, 5186, 1827, '<td valign="top">VERY nicely done.  The motion blur is terrific.  I tried for a shot like this this week, but failed miserably.  The colors here are also superb.   I also like the different perspective.  Good choice to shoot from above.   Now, here are my questions.  I have the opportunity to learn:  how did you manage to avoid graininess in such low light conditions?  Also, did you use your flash?  How long was your shutter open and did you use a tripod?  I appreciate it so much if you take the time to respond to these.  BTW, this is in my top ten for the week.  8, just-married</td>', 'VERY nicely done.  The motion blur is terrific.  I tried for a shot like this this week, but failed miserably.  The colors here are also superb.   I also like the different perspective.  Good choice to shoot from above.   Now, here are my questions.  I have the opportunity to learn:  how did you manage to avoid graininess in such low light conditions?  Also, did you use your flash?  How long was your shutter open and did you use a tripod?  I appreciate it so much if you take the time to respond to these.  BTW, this is in my top ten for the week.  8, just-married', '2002-09-04 17:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
