(115499, 5189, 2764, '<td valign="top">I LOVE it.  Eapecially the color rainbow, Red, orange, yellow straw, green cup, all in a row,  Two people, two straws, People lean in, straws lean out, so nice.  Ocean is beautifully neutral and is the stone seat.  His black hair balances her black butt.  Her bent arm cntrasts his straight arm.  So many subtle design elements,  look at: straight horison, straight bench, his straight shirt cuffs.  look at her: leaning, bending arm, flipped hair, tilted watch.   And such a tender mood.  Changes?  maybe edit out his cowlick/  And definately change the title.  I think the mood is quiet, she''s not chattering!</td>', 'I LOVE it.  Eapecially the color rainbow, Red, orange, yellow straw, green cup, all in a row,  Two people, two straws, People lean in, straws lean out, so nice.  Ocean is beautifully neutral and is the stone seat.  His black hair balances her black butt.  Her bent arm cntrasts his straight arm.  So many subtle design elements,  look at: straight horison, straight bench, his straight shirt cuffs.  look at her: leaning, bending arm, flipped hair, tilted watch.   And such a tender mood.  Changes?  maybe edit out his cowlick/  And definately change the title.  I think the mood is quiet, she''s not chattering!', '2002-09-05 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
