(115532, 5192, 3645, '<td valign="top">Great Image. I dont think this would have evoked the same feeling in color as it does B&amp;W. Good composition. Good use of lighting. Nice angle. DOF is clear which enhances the reflection making for a well balanced image. Great job!</td>', 'Great Image. I dont think this would have evoked the same feeling in color as it does B&W. Good composition. Good use of lighting. Nice angle. DOF is clear which enhances the reflection making for a well balanced image. Great job!', '2002-09-02 17:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(115533, 5192, 2353, '<td valign="top">This is definately one of my favorites of the week.  The expression on his face gives loads of emotion to the picture.  Also, good composition...I love how you''ve captured the reflection in the metal wall..adds a lot of interest.  I maybe wouldn''t have cropped so tightly on top, though...but maybe that couldn''t have been helped.  In my opinion, this is one of the few picutes of the week that truly meets the challenge in every way..a real candid moment with good photographic technique...great job! 10 -KrazyKat</td>', 'This is definately one of my favorites of the week.  The expression on his face gives loads of emotion to the picture.  Also, good composition...I love how you''ve captured the reflection in the metal wall..adds a lot of interest.  I maybe wouldn''t have cropped so tightly on top, though...but maybe that couldn''t have been helped.  In my opinion, this is one of the few picutes of the week that truly meets the challenge in every way..a real candid moment with good photographic technique...great job! 10 -KrazyKat', '2002-09-02 17:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
