(115696, 5198, 3102, '<td valign="top">Overall I think it''s a neat shot with the interesting colors of the water, etc.  I''m not sure it does a lot for me in regard to the challenge though.  It may have been more effective to have focused on the expression of an individual player.  Better yet, focus on one player and wait for him/her to make a bad shot, and capture their reaction.</td>', 'Overall I think it''s a neat shot with the interesting colors of the water, etc.  I''m not sure it does a lot for me in regard to the challenge though.  It may have been more effective to have focused on the expression of an individual player.  Better yet, focus on one player and wait for him/her to make a bad shot, and capture their reaction.', '2002-09-04 22:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
