(115703, 5200, 772, '<td valign="top">This photo is ''candid'' because I can see that it was not setup and not planned.  The ''candid'' element of the photo is, in my opinion, weak, because of the subject.  I think that the people shots are a bit stronger on the subject because it''s easier to show a strong candid moment and create a better tie into the challenge :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This photo is ''candid'' because I can see that it was not setup and not planned.  The ''candid'' element of the photo is, in my opinion, weak, because of the subject.  I think that the people shots are a bit stronger on the subject because it''s easier to show a strong candid moment and create a better tie into the challenge :) - jmsetzler', '2002-09-02 03:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
