(115724, 5202, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the tender expression on her face.  Even though this woman is not nearly old enough, it reminds me of a nursing home i used to volunteer at that had animals.  Great shot.  The white of the window sets up some nice contrast, but some of the dog is lost in the window sill.  I like this shot. karmat</td>', 'I like the tender expression on her face.  Even though this woman is not nearly old enough, it reminds me of a nursing home i used to volunteer at that had animals.  Great shot.  The white of the window sets up some nice contrast, but some of the dog is lost in the window sill.  I like this shot. karmat', '2002-09-04 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
