(115748, 5203, 3612, '<td valign="top">so a lot of people commented on the amount of grain in the photo and wanted an explanation, so here it goes:<br/><br/>i shot the photo and didn''t have time to set my 1.3MP camera to the correct size... oops!  got home, resized, fixed levels, and ended up with lines... i still liked the photo, it reminded me of the grain in newspaper photos, and decided to submit it.<br/><br/>thanks to all of you that gave me feedback, it is greatly appreciated!<br/><br/>-jen</td>', 'so a lot of people commented on the amount of grain in the photo and wanted an explanation, so here it goes:i shot the photo and didn''t have time to set my 1.3MP camera to the correct size... oops!  got home, resized, fixed levels, and ended up with lines... i still liked the photo, it reminded me of the grain in newspaper photos, and decided to submit it.thanks to all of you that gave me feedback, it is greatly appreciated!-jen', '2002-09-09 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 0),
