(115780, 5209, 3105, '<td valign="top">This shot has an amazing ambiance to it.  Being in B&amp;W and overexposed really helps to convey a lot of feeling.  It looks like a scene that could take place anywhere and to anyone and the posture of the guy on the right sort of gives it a melencholy feel.  The only thing that I would like more is for the guy on the left in the sweatpants to be out of the frame as his prescence detracts a little from the feel of the other man.  Well done.<br/>Score: 10<br/>Courtenay</td>', 'This shot has an amazing ambiance to it.  Being in B&W and overexposed really helps to convey a lot of feeling.  It looks like a scene that could take place anywhere and to anyone and the posture of the guy on the right sort of gives it a melencholy feel.  The only thing that I would like more is for the guy on the left in the sweatpants to be out of the frame as his prescence detracts a little from the feel of the other man.  Well done.Score: 10Courtenay', '2002-09-04 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
