(116598, 5266, 3320, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, angle, exposure and I like the litle ''movement'' in the arms. I cannot say I would like to frame the picture, it does not ''appeeal'' to me that much but for this challenge, this is very good.. Maybe a little too ''centered'' ... but nice shot. 7. Lionel</td>', 'Nice composition, angle, exposure and I like the litle ''movement'' in the arms. I cannot say I would like to frame the picture, it does not ''appeeal'' to me that much but for this challenge, this is very good.. Maybe a little too ''centered'' ... but nice shot. 7. Lionel', '2002-09-03 20:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(116599, 5266, 3645, '<td valign="top">The camera angle combined with the location give a very nice sense of tunnel vision. ; ) The DOF is good along with the sharpness of the focus. Even the tiles on the distant wall look clear. The vanishing point lays just aside the only motion in an otherwise static image. This adds more interest as my eye is drawn by the motion and color of her sweater almost to the same place as the VP. In another version you might consider making only the sweater a few shades more vibrant in order to add impact especially if you used the photo in B/W. Considering the topic and the previous mentioned attributes you did a great job. Nicely done!</td>', 'The camera angle combined with the location give a very nice sense of tunnel vision. ; ) The DOF is good along with the sharpness of the focus. Even the tiles on the distant wall look clear. The vanishing point lays just aside the only motion in an otherwise static image. This adds more interest as my eye is drawn by the motion and color of her sweater almost to the same place as the VP. In another version you might consider making only the sweater a few shades more vibrant in order to add impact especially if you used the photo in B/W. Considering the topic and the previous mentioned attributes you did a great job. Nicely done!', '2002-09-03 20:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
