(116634, 5267, 3575, '<td valign="top">Oh...the little sweetheart! How would it be to be the only kid on the bench. Great shot! this is when the phrase "A picture is worth a thousand words" is true. There is such irony in this picture. It''s obvious that their is a lot of noise and action going on somewhere nearby yet this photo is incredibly still. Not only that, it''s technically good.</td>', 'Oh...the little sweetheart! How would it be to be the only kid on the bench. Great shot! this is when the phrase "A picture is worth a thousand words" is true. There is such irony in this picture. It''s obvious that their is a lot of noise and action going on somewhere nearby yet this photo is incredibly still. Not only that, it''s technically good.', '2002-09-04 12:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
