(116789, 5276, 1037, '<td valign="top">Hehe, unfortunately heavy makeup under a camera''s harsh flash makes a woman look rather like a drag queen....  but maybe it''s for that reason that I like this one :). I''m a bit proccupied with the way women are always supposed to be photographed in a "flattering" way... I like this because it''s so natural and fun, and neither of these women seem to care at all about the photographer getting their "good side".</td>', 'Hehe, unfortunately heavy makeup under a camera''s harsh flash makes a woman look rather like a drag queen....  but maybe it''s for that reason that I like this one :). I''m a bit proccupied with the way women are always supposed to be photographed in a "flattering" way... I like this because it''s so natural and fun, and neither of these women seem to care at all about the photographer getting their "good side".', '2002-09-04 07:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
