(116793, 5276, 1897, '<td valign="top">Shots like this frustrate me.  Tim, I am sorry I was rude, but I do not understand the point of submitting something like this.  It seems that sometime people just snap a shot, just to get in the competion.    If this was a serious effort, I apologize, and keep up. You bullpen shot was very good.  If you are trying to learn photography, subscribe to Popular Photography, and keep snap and posting.   Also, learn post processing.  There is good software, and books on how to use it well.<br/><br/>Also, light in one of the most important elements in a photo, and on-camera flash is the worst way to get it.</td>', 'Shots like this frustrate me.  Tim, I am sorry I was rude, but I do not understand the point of submitting something like this.  It seems that sometime people just snap a shot, just to get in the competion.    If this was a serious effort, I apologize, and keep up. You bullpen shot was very good.  If you are trying to learn photography, subscribe to Popular Photography, and keep snap and posting.   Also, learn post processing.  There is good software, and books on how to use it well.Also, light in one of the most important elements in a photo, and on-camera flash is the worst way to get it.', '2002-09-10 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 0),
