(116912, 5284, 3469, '<td valign="top">The problem with this picture is the load of details. In the original picture that may have been a good point, but down at 640x480 it is getting blurred. In short the picture is lacking focus on a particular point; the person that has been photographed candidly does not evoke an emotion, since we cannot see what she is relating to in particular. Technically the picture is OK, lighting, focus, but that is not what makes a good picture, it is only a starting point.</td>', 'The problem with this picture is the load of details. In the original picture that may have been a good point, but down at 640x480 it is getting blurred. In short the picture is lacking focus on a particular point; the person that has been photographed candidly does not evoke an emotion, since we cannot see what she is relating to in particular. Technically the picture is OK, lighting, focus, but that is not what makes a good picture, it is only a starting point.', '2002-09-02 18:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
