(117018, 5293, 2928, '<td valign="top">Sleeping beauty would have been a good title for this shot :o)  The lighting and composition are superb.  The shot has a really good atmosphere of calm and tranquillity.  In terms of the challenge, it''s a fine line between staged and candid. Therefore, because the shot is good enough not to look set up, I''d have to say that the challenge is well met. (10)</td>', 'Sleeping beauty would have been a good title for this shot :o)  The lighting and composition are superb.  The shot has a really good atmosphere of calm and tranquillity.  In terms of the challenge, it''s a fine line between staged and candid. Therefore, because the shot is good enough not to look set up, I''d have to say that the challenge is well met. (10)', '2002-09-04 07:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
