(117122, 5297, 2829, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of my favorite shots that I have seen. The colors and subject matter are great. Technically this photo is excellent. I wouldn''t be surprised seeing this in a gallery at some gallery or museum. The subtle shadows, the look on their faces is excellent. One very very minor suggestion I would try is dodging the womans face (I understand spot editing is not allowed for this particular site but for your own photo I would see if it gives an improvement)</td>', 'I think this is one of my favorite shots that I have seen. The colors and subject matter are great. Technically this photo is excellent. I wouldn''t be surprised seeing this in a gallery at some gallery or museum. The subtle shadows, the look on their faces is excellent. One very very minor suggestion I would try is dodging the womans face (I understand spot editing is not allowed for this particular site but for your own photo I would see if it gives an improvement)', '2002-09-07 11:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
