(117128, 5297, 2204, '<td valign="top">I think you captured the hearts of the voting community this week.  Such wonderful feeling is tied up in this picture.  I''d love to hear how and where you stumbled across this scene.  This would have been a good candidate for  #1 but I have to admit giving you a 9 and the old woman a 10.  Sorry.  (The ONLY 9 and 10 I gave this week)<br/><br/>Congrautlation on this well deserved award.<br/><br/>Sy  :''-D</td>', 'I think you captured the hearts of the voting community this week.  Such wonderful feeling is tied up in this picture.  I''d love to hear how and where you stumbled across this scene.  This would have been a good candidate for  #1 but I have to admit giving you a 9 and the old woman a 10.  Sorry.  (The ONLY 9 and 10 I gave this week)Congrautlation on this well deserved award.Sy  :''-D', '2002-09-09 02:12:00.000000', NULL, 0),
