(117130, 5297, 1128, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry I didn''t have the chance to comment while the voting was happening, but this is one of the best photos I have seen on this site.  I actually caught my breath when I first saw it.  Wonderful job and congratulations!</td>', 'I''m sorry I didn''t have the chance to comment while the voting was happening, but this is one of the best photos I have seen on this site.  I actually caught my breath when I first saw it.  Wonderful job and congratulations!', '2002-09-09 06:49:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(117131, 5297, 3102, '<td valign="top">Woo hoo!  I don''t have to eat my hat!  (See my comment during voting :)</td>', 'Woo hoo!  I don''t have to eat my hat!  (See my comment during voting :)', '2002-09-09 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(117132, 5297, 1993, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for the lovely comments.  I wish I could take full credit for "finding" this couple, but my wonderful boyfriend saw them first, and handed me this opportunity.  I really enjoy taking candid shots and they were just so adorable, all dressed up on Saturday afternoon, sitting at the Third St. Promenade, an open air mall, in Santa Monica, California.  Just as I went to take the first shot, the old man got up....so, I had to wait, surreptitiously, to catch them, together.  And, I liked this one the best, with him still putting his change in his pocket, while she is opening her sugar packet.  They seem to be separated, yet they are very much together.  Thank you all again for the wonderful votes and comments.</td>', 'Thank you everyone for the lovely comments.  I wish I could take full credit for "finding" this couple, but my wonderful boyfriend saw them first, and handed me this opportunity.  I really enjoy taking candid shots and they were just so adorable, all dressed up on Saturday afternoon, sitting at the Third St. Promenade, an open air mall, in Santa Monica, California.  Just as I went to take the first shot, the old man got up....so, I had to wait, surreptitiously, to catch them, together.  And, I liked this one the best, with him still putting his change in his pocket, while she is opening her sugar packet.  They seem to be separated, yet they are very much together.  Thank you all again for the wonderful votes and comments.', '2002-09-09 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(117133, 5298, 3415, '<td valign="top">good study in orange</td>', 'good study in orange', '2002-09-02 03:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
