(117168, 5299, 1827, '<td valign="top">Well, I didn''t really feel that this met the challenge.  I know people get tired of hearing it, but I figure at least if I explain you''ll know WHY I voted the way I did, whether you agree or not.  If she had been there, but not visible for a motion blur, that would have worked for me.  But this is just a photo of a shower door.  The reflection of the flash on the right is a distraction to me.  This might be an example of me not understanding the humor.  If so, at least you know.  2, just-married.</td>', 'Well, I didn''t really feel that this met the challenge.  I know people get tired of hearing it, but I figure at least if I explain you''ll know WHY I voted the way I did, whether you agree or not.  If she had been there, but not visible for a motion blur, that would have worked for me.  But this is just a photo of a shower door.  The reflection of the flash on the right is a distraction to me.  This might be an example of me not understanding the humor.  If so, at least you know.  2, just-married.', '2002-09-04 17:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117169, 5299, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this seems like a bit of a cop-out for the challenge... I appreciate the attempt at humor, though...</td>', 'I''m afraid this seems like a bit of a cop-out for the challenge... I appreciate the attempt at humor, though...', '2002-09-04 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
