(117267, 5306, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-09-03 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117268, 5306, 3102, '<td valign="top">Well done!  I love the look on the cop''s face.  You were certainly at the right place at the right time for this one.</td>', 'Well done!  I love the look on the cop''s face.  You were certainly at the right place at the right time for this one.', '2002-09-03 21:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117269, 5306, 2932, '<td valign="top">mood captured - man, how come my buddy always gets away, and I get the shaft?<br/>sincerity of expressions - surprisingly average</td>', 'mood captured - man, how come my buddy always gets away, and I get the shaft?sincerity of expressions - surprisingly average', '2002-09-04 02:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117270, 5306, 2928, '<td valign="top">Although this picture is over exposed, I''d still have to say it''s superb.  The shot has met the challenge with aplomb.  The faces of the subjects are inspired and the composition is spot on.  Bad exposure? Yes.  Less than a ten? No (10)</td>', 'Although this picture is over exposed, I''d still have to say it''s superb.  The shot has met the challenge with aplomb.  The faces of the subjects are inspired and the composition is spot on.  Bad exposure? Yes.  Less than a ten? No (10)', '2002-09-04 06:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117271, 5306, 2829, '<td valign="top">I love this shot for the subject matter, I do not think you have properly exposed it however, the whites are washed out on the car and the bus. A lesser problem is with the dark colors on the cops uniform. Proper exposure would have received a slightly higher score.</td>', 'I love this shot for the subject matter, I do not think you have properly exposed it however, the whites are washed out on the car and the bus. A lesser problem is with the dark colors on the cops uniform. Proper exposure would have received a slightly higher score.', '2002-09-04 10:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117272, 5306, 3044, '<td valign="top">nice shot. love the look and stance of the police officer. he standing like some kind of wild west gunslinger. the whites look blown out to me. 7 goodtimecharlee</td>', 'nice shot. love the look and stance of the police officer. he standing like some kind of wild west gunslinger. the whites look blown out to me. 7 goodtimecharlee', '2002-09-04 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117273, 5306, 3575, '<td valign="top">Oh Oh, looks like you''re in trouble too! Great "chance taking"</td>', 'Oh Oh, looks like you''re in trouble too! Great "chance taking"', '2002-09-04 13:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117274, 5306, 811, '<td valign="top">Don''t think that cop was really happy about the picture.  I like the high contrast in this.  karmat</td>', 'Don''t think that cop was really happy about the picture.  I like the high contrast in this.  karmat', '2002-09-04 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117275, 5306, 1143, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool shot - very "photojournalistic". The bright white (overexposed) areas bug me though. Still, extra points for being brave enough to shoot THAT guy  :o)  ~indigo997</td>', 'This is a really cool shot - very "photojournalistic". The bright white (overexposed) areas bug me though. Still, extra points for being brave enough to shoot THAT guy  :o)  ~indigo997', '2002-09-04 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117276, 5306, 1827, '<td valign="top">VERY NICE INDEED.  It''s very stark, which works perfectly for the moment captured.  This is my absolute favorite pic of the week.  It ENTIRELY embodies my idea of candid.  The expression on the cop''s face MAKES this photo.  Black and white was a great decision.  You should be in the top three for sure, or I''ll be really disappointed.  9, just-married<br/><br/>In a complete aside, I''d love to see other shots you took for this challenge and any tips on how you acheived such clarity in the pic.</td>', 'VERY NICE INDEED.  It''s very stark, which works perfectly for the moment captured.  This is my absolute favorite pic of the week.  It ENTIRELY embodies my idea of candid.  The expression on the cop''s face MAKES this photo.  Black and white was a great decision.  You should be in the top three for sure, or I''ll be really disappointed.  9, just-marriedIn a complete aside, I''d love to see other shots you took for this challenge and any tips on how you acheived such clarity in the pic.', '2002-09-04 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117277, 5306, 3105, '<td valign="top">What can I say?  I love black and white candids and this is no exception.  Overexposure helps, I think.  The only thing that would have made it more appealing to my eye would probably be the use of a higher ISO speed if the camera allows for it.  The added noise (grain) could have helped with the mood of the photo.  The cop looks like he''s proud of taking the perp into custody, almost like he''s smiling ang striking a heroic(ish) pose.  :)  Great job!<br/>Score: 9<br/>Courtenay</td>', 'What can I say?  I love black and white candids and this is no exception.  Overexposure helps, I think.  The only thing that would have made it more appealing to my eye would probably be the use of a higher ISO speed if the camera allows for it.  The added noise (grain) could have helped with the mood of the photo.  The cop looks like he''s proud of taking the perp into custody, almost like he''s smiling ang striking a heroic(ish) pose.  :)  Great job!Score: 9Courtenay', '2002-09-04 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117278, 5306, 3317, '<td valign="top">quit your day job.</td>', 'quit your day job.', '2002-09-05 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117279, 5306, 1826, '<td valign="top">Great job! The look on the policeman''s face is priceless! Black and white was a great choice too. 9 Kaz</td>', 'Great job! The look on the policeman''s face is priceless! Black and white was a great choice too. 9 Kaz', '2002-09-05 07:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117280, 5306, 748, '<td valign="top">He has his eyes on you, wondering what you are up to.  The shot is a bit overexposed, but candid.</td>', 'He has his eyes on you, wondering what you are up to.  The shot is a bit overexposed, but candid.', '2002-09-05 07:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117281, 5306, 368, '<td valign="top">i like the concept of this photo .. but i wish the officer wasnt looking at the camera - i guess some things cant be controlled ... Ayme -5</td>', 'i like the concept of this photo .. but i wish the officer wasnt looking at the camera - i guess some things cant be controlled ... Ayme -5', '2002-09-05 14:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117282, 5306, 2586, '<td valign="top">Great candid. Then again, maybe you''re a cop and you staged this (just joking). Love the expression on their faces. The cop obviously dreaded someone with a camera in the vicinity. 8 Journey</td>', 'Great candid. Then again, maybe you''re a cop and you staged this (just joking). Love the expression on their faces. The cop obviously dreaded someone with a camera in the vicinity. 8 Journey', '2002-09-05 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
