(117294, 5306, 1325, '<td valign="top">I missed your picture in the vote or you would have had at least another 9.  Black and white or colored the real eye catcher is the expression on the officiers face.  He wants to look like a big old cop who is in control but he is amused that he &amp; his "bad guy" are the subject of a photograph by a citizen.</td>', 'I missed your picture in the vote or you would have had at least another 9.  Black and white or colored the real eye catcher is the expression on the officiers face.  He wants to look like a big old cop who is in control but he is amused that he & his "bad guy" are the subject of a photograph by a citizen.', '2002-09-09 19:28:00.000000', NULL, 0);
