(117295, 5306, 472, '<td valign="top">thanks for all the support folks.  ok, the cop didnt know i was taking their pic. i did it totally stealthily holding my camera to my side and squeezed off 4 shots. 3 of them were perfectly exposed but the heads were cut off. 1 was this one.  he was looking at me because i was standing there, and he just happened to look my way .. <br/><br/>anyway ..</td>', 'thanks for all the support folks.  ok, the cop didnt know i was taking their pic. i did it totally stealthily holding my camera to my side and squeezed off 4 shots. 3 of them were perfectly exposed but the heads were cut off. 1 was this one.  he was looking at me because i was standing there, and he just happened to look my way .. anyway ..', '2002-09-10 00:45:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(165586, 5255, 1005, '<td valign="top">This has always been a fav of mine.  The action is great and the composition is perfect!  Go speed racer!</td>', 'This has always been a fav of mine.  The action is great and the composition is perfect!  Go speed racer!', '2002-12-06 12:51:54.000000', NULL, 0),
