(114103, 5073, 811, '<td valign="top">A fruit and veggie shot!!!!  I love her expression! and the people in the background are interesting too.  karmat</td>', 'A fruit and veggie shot!!!!  I love her expression! and the people in the background are interesting too.  karmat', '2002-09-04 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114104, 5073, 1005, '<td valign="top">Fine photo!  Good color, focus, framing.  Her expression isn''t the best, but it''s a candid shot, after all.  I think she is about to weigh her broccolli?  Suggestion:  wait for her to start to place the items in the basket (I think it would add a little more interest, tell more story...but who knows.)  8 Swash</td>', 'Fine photo!  Good color, focus, framing.  Her expression isn''t the best, but it''s a candid shot, after all.  I think she is about to weigh her broccolli?  Suggestion:  wait for her to start to place the items in the basket (I think it would add a little more interest, tell more story...but who knows.)  8 Swash', '2002-09-04 19:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114105, 5073, 637, '<td valign="top">I like this concept, but I see the image as rather pedestrian... I gotta believe there were zillions of other oppties to snap candid shots of customers or vendors at this market.  4 sjgleah</td>', 'I like this concept, but I see the image as rather pedestrian... I gotta believe there were zillions of other oppties to snap candid shots of customers or vendors at this market.  4 sjgleah', '2002-09-05 15:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
