(114122, 5074, 3524, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great candid. It feels very textured and real. Good physical and tonal range.<br/>I certainly hope your votes don''t suffer because your main subject is making eye contact. The gaze helps make the picture.</td>', 'I think this is a great candid. It feels very textured and real. Good physical and tonal range.I certainly hope your votes don''t suffer because your main subject is making eye contact. The gaze helps make the picture.', '2002-09-04 02:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114123, 5074, 3044, '<td valign="top">this is a great shot. my first impression was this isnt really a candid but i was assuming the person in the foreground was the focus. it certainly is a candid of the 2 people in the background. love the b&amp;w. it seems a tad soft. good tonal range. 9 goodtimecharlee</td>', 'this is a great shot. my first impression was this isnt really a candid but i was assuming the person in the foreground was the focus. it certainly is a candid of the 2 people in the background. love the b&w. it seems a tad soft. good tonal range. 9 goodtimecharlee', '2002-09-04 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114124, 5074, 3105, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The subject has a really great expression and she is well placed within the frame.  Her eyes really draw me into the photo.  I like this in black and white and even though some of the whites seem a little bright the image is well exposed.  I really wish that she was the only person in the shot though because the guy with the turned head and the other im mid sentence kind of distract me from the main subject and to a lesser extent the dark cloth (?) on the left of the frame does too.  Really good job with the subject though and the background has a nice texture.<br/>Score: 8<br/>Courtenay</td>', 'Nice shot.  The subject has a really great expression and she is well placed within the frame.  Her eyes really draw me into the photo.  I like this in black and white and even though some of the whites seem a little bright the image is well exposed.  I really wish that she was the only person in the shot though because the guy with the turned head and the other im mid sentence kind of distract me from the main subject and to a lesser extent the dark cloth (?) on the left of the frame does too.  Really good job with the subject though and the background has a nice texture.Score: 8Courtenay', '2002-09-05 23:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
