(114186, 5085, 2923, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection, and the colors.  Decent composition, etc.   The only thing I can suggest is that  it''d be better if she was having a different expression or turn slightly to the right so her face can be seen in the reflection.  I like it -- it keeps me wanting to look at the mirror.   Oh yeah, one more thing:  Can I get her number? :-)  Just kidding.  7.5 = "8"  paganini</td>', 'I like the reflection, and the colors.  Decent composition, etc.   The only thing I can suggest is that  it''d be better if she was having a different expression or turn slightly to the right so her face can be seen in the reflection.  I like it -- it keeps me wanting to look at the mirror.   Oh yeah, one more thing:  Can I get her number? :-)  Just kidding.  7.5 = "8"  paganini', '2002-09-02 18:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114187, 5085, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, and she does look like someone who doesn''t need to do much to herself to look good :)  I think there are a few too many distractions, though, like the image taped to the mirror (I''ll probably go to hell for suggesting that it not be included...).  Great concept, though.</td>', 'I like the concept, and she does look like someone who doesn''t need to do much to herself to look good :)  I think there are a few too many distractions, though, like the image taped to the mirror (I''ll probably go to hell for suggesting that it not be included...).  Great concept, though.', '2002-09-02 22:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
