(114193, 5085, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  Parts of me like the hair in front of the face (adds some mystery), while the rest of me says show the face.  Is the blouse made of a fuzzy materiel?  Most of the photo looks fairly crisp, except for the blouse.  8 Swash</td>', 'Good photo.  Parts of me like the hair in front of the face (adds some mystery), while the rest of me says show the face.  Is the blouse made of a fuzzy materiel?  Most of the photo looks fairly crisp, except for the blouse.  8 Swash', '2002-09-04 19:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114194, 5085, 2110, '<td valign="top">Nice painted background. Perhaps  you could have moved a little left while taking the picture, and zoomed a little bit on the top ( to avoid the yellow on the top and the right).</td>', 'Nice painted background. Perhaps  you could have moved a little left while taking the picture, and zoomed a little bit on the top ( to avoid the yellow on the top and the right).', '2002-09-06 07:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114195, 5085, 3575, '<td valign="top">Thank you to everybody who commented. You were all very generous! This was my first entry and I tried twice to de-enter this but I''m glad I kept it in because your suggestions and critiques are invaluable. You asked the questions:<br/><br/>Can she cook? No <br/>Can I get her number? No<br/>Alansfreed: Yep! LOL<br/>Looking good is hard -- sometimes impossible -- hope we never have a "self portrait" challenge.<br/>Her father painted the big flower on the wall, thank you.<br/>The blouse isn''t fuzzy. Must be my shakey hand.<br/><br/>Thank you again to everybody. I think with some PS trickery I can add this to my album.<br/>Jo Ann<br/><br/><br/><br/><br/></td>', 'Thank you to everybody who commented. You were all very generous! This was my first entry and I tried twice to de-enter this but I''m glad I kept it in because your suggestions and critiques are invaluable. You asked the questions:Can she cook? No Can I get her number? NoAlansfreed: Yep! LOLLooking good is hard -- sometimes impossible -- hope we never have a "self portrait" challenge.Her father painted the big flower on the wall, thank you.The blouse isn''t fuzzy. Must be my shakey hand.Thank you again to everybody. I think with some PS trickery I can add this to my album.Jo Ann', '2002-09-09 17:13:00.000000', NULL, 0),
