(114224, 5087, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m going to save this picture, print it out, and remind my 4-year-old daughter on a daily basis that I don''t EVER want her to bring this home with her...!  Oh, nice picture, by the way :)  It does a great job of capturing a moment, to be sure!</td>', 'I''m going to save this picture, print it out, and remind my 4-year-old daughter on a daily basis that I don''t EVER want her to bring this home with her...!  Oh, nice picture, by the way :)  It does a great job of capturing a moment, to be sure!', '2002-09-04 21:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
