(114244, 5089, 1897, '<td valign="top">Great expression.  The exposure is a little flat, and it is a little blurry.  Did you use a tripod? Glad you did not use a flash.  Fun picture.  May have been better as a horizontal, cutting out some of the top, and showing more of the face.</td>', 'Great expression.  The exposure is a little flat, and it is a little blurry.  Did you use a tripod? Glad you did not use a flash.  Fun picture.  May have been better as a horizontal, cutting out some of the top, and showing more of the face.', '2002-09-03 00:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
