(114486, 5118, 1037, '<td valign="top">Beautiful black and white, beautiful light, beautiful textures to that fur/hair, and gorgeous composition/framing. This is a breathtaking photo for me. I''m sure many people don''t think it meets the challenge, but all the definitions of "candid" allow this, in my opinion. 10 - lisae</td>', 'Beautiful black and white, beautiful light, beautiful textures to that fur/hair, and gorgeous composition/framing. This is a breathtaking photo for me. I''m sure many people don''t think it meets the challenge, but all the definitions of "candid" allow this, in my opinion. 10 - lisae', '2002-09-04 06:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
