(114489, 5118, 3354, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of black and white.  Do you use any filters in this shot? or just shoot in Black and White - no filters?  The contrast is really nice.  -phlebotiss</td>', 'Very nice use of black and white.  Do you use any filters in this shot? or just shoot in Black and White - no filters?  The contrast is really nice.  -phlebotiss', '2002-09-04 22:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
