(114493, 5118, 2798, '<td valign="top">To any of you still reading - this picture was deliberately muddled. I chose a crop and a shot that intentionally made it hard to figure out what was what. For me it added to the atmosphere of the shot. There''s something about the way cats sleep all curled up around each other that seems comfortably muddled.</td>', 'To any of you still reading - this picture was deliberately muddled. I chose a crop and a shot that intentionally made it hard to figure out what was what. For me it added to the atmosphere of the shot. There''s something about the way cats sleep all curled up around each other that seems comfortably muddled.', '2002-09-14 09:49:00.000000', NULL, 0),
