 I dont have any problem with the picture but perhaps the challenge link is a little weaker  in my perception at any rate  than it could have been I know thats a matter for debate, and I hope the shot does well despite my opinion (7)</td>', 'This is a great picture of a very cute child and as portraits go, I don''t think it can be faulted.  The use of B&W is great I dont have any problem with the picture but perhaps the challenge link is a little weaker  in my perception at any rate  than it could have been I know thats a matter for debate, and I hope the shot does well despite my opinion (7)', '2002-09-02 18:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
