(114656, 5133, 3102, '<td valign="top">It seems like you may almost be taunting people into giving this a bad rating.  The title suggests that the group should be looking into the camera (which they are), and that defeats the "candid" requirement.  Even putting that aside, I''m not fond of the tilted effect and the clarity and composition of the image.  Sorry...</td>', 'It seems like you may almost be taunting people into giving this a bad rating.  The title suggests that the group should be looking into the camera (which they are), and that defeats the "candid" requirement.  Even putting that aside, I''m not fond of the tilted effect and the clarity and composition of the image.  Sorry...', '2002-09-02 22:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
