(114914, 5142, 3050, '<td valign="top">Love the framing of the clouds and the bird in sunlight.  Very nicely done.  I might have chosen (cause I like birds a lot) to make it a horizontal shot both to reduce the empty blue above and to make the bird bigger... but excelent wildlife candid.</td>', 'Love the framing of the clouds and the bird in sunlight.  Very nicely done.  I might have chosen (cause I like birds a lot) to make it a horizontal shot both to reduce the empty blue above and to make the bird bigger... but excelent wildlife candid.', '2002-09-03 00:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
