(114918, 5142, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  I am so glad you caught it in the sunlight, it looks like shade from a cloud was approaching.  At first, I didn''t like all the negative space, but it grows on you.  This might have been a touch better if all the thaching were in the sunlight, but it''s still a 10 in my book!  Congrats and hope you win!  Swash</td>', 'This is a great shot.  I am so glad you caught it in the sunlight, it looks like shade from a cloud was approaching.  At first, I didn''t like all the negative space, but it grows on you.  This might have been a touch better if all the thaching were in the sunlight, but it''s still a 10 in my book!  Congrats and hope you win!  Swash', '2002-09-03 19:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114919, 5142, 3320, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I like the picture a lot. Might have prefered the animal looking the other way but you probably did not have tha much choice. Very nice composition (except the ''orientation'') and exposure. Sorry to me it does not meet the spirit of the challenge. -2 for that this week. Overall 6 (8 an other week).</td>', 'Sorry, I like the picture a lot. Might have prefered the animal looking the other way but you probably did not have tha much choice. Very nice composition (except the ''orientation'') and exposure. Sorry to me it does not meet the spirit of the challenge. -2 for that this week. Overall 6 (8 an other week).', '2002-09-03 21:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
