(114934, 5142, 1037, '<td valign="top">This photo is just incredibly beautiful. Somehow all that sky gives me the impression that this is an instant in time, and the bird, if it decides to, will escape into the air and fly away if you make any noise or sudden movements. I couldn''t possibly not give it a 10 - lisae</td>', 'This photo is just incredibly beautiful. Somehow all that sky gives me the impression that this is an instant in time, and the bird, if it decides to, will escape into the air and fly away if you make any noise or sudden movements. I couldn''t possibly not give it a 10 - lisae', '2002-09-07 06:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
