(114957, 5143, 2553, '<td valign="top">At first, I thought that I would like this better if it was cropped tighter, but after trying it, I realized that I like the expanse of the field - it seems to give more "weight" to the subjects.  I really like this shot, and think it fits the challenge well. lhall-8</td>', 'At first, I thought that I would like this better if it was cropped tighter, but after trying it, I realized that I like the expanse of the field - it seems to give more "weight" to the subjects.  I really like this shot, and think it fits the challenge well. lhall-8', '2002-09-03 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
