(114977, 5144, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the *idea*, and the general composition, but the subjects don''t have enough "weight" in the shot for me.  I feel like I need to be able to see their faces better, (though I realize  that may not have been possible).  lhall-7</td>', 'I like the *idea*, and the general composition, but the subjects don''t have enough "weight" in the shot for me.  I feel like I need to be able to see their faces better, (though I realize  that may not have been possible).  lhall-7', '2002-09-03 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114978, 5144, 3320, '<td valign="top">I like the shot but even if I am not a systematic fan of the rule of third but I think the limit water/ground is a little too much in the middle even if the boat is at a ''rule of third'' intersection. 5 (might move to 6 later)</td>', 'I like the shot but even if I am not a systematic fan of the rule of third but I think the limit water/ground is a little too much in the middle even if the boat is at a ''rule of third'' intersection. 5 (might move to 6 later)', '2002-09-03 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114979, 5144, 3645, '<td valign="top">This meets the challenge and I like fishing so this automatically appeals to me. Makes me want to take my boat out again so I can get the same enjoyment. Nice shot with decent clarity.</td>', 'This meets the challenge and I like fishing so this automatically appeals to me. Makes me want to take my boat out again so I can get the same enjoyment. Nice shot with decent clarity.', '2002-09-03 21:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114980, 5144, 51167, '<td valign="top">Great color and great picture.</td>', 'Great color and great picture.', '2002-09-04 03:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114981, 5144, 3105, '<td valign="top">I like this photo for its peaceful, laid back feel and the color balance between the water and foliage.  The fishermen are nicely placed within the frame with a good amount of water showing to emphasize the tension of waiting for a bite.  I think I would like to see slightly more saturated greens and maybe blue also.  Plus, maybe reposition the shot so that less of the trees show at the top of the frame and a little more of the foreground water where the fisherman on the right is casting.  Aside from the little wishlist, it''s a very well done photo.<br/>Score: 9<br/>Courtenay</td>', 'I like this photo for its peaceful, laid back feel and the color balance between the water and foliage.  The fishermen are nicely placed within the frame with a good amount of water showing to emphasize the tension of waiting for a bite.  I think I would like to see slightly more saturated greens and maybe blue also.  Plus, maybe reposition the shot so that less of the trees show at the top of the frame and a little more of the foreground water where the fisherman on the right is casting.  Aside from the little wishlist, it''s a very well done photo.Score: 9Courtenay', '2002-09-04 16:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114982, 5144, 1030, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2002-09-05 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114983, 5144, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice candid.. the composition is also excellent... The color saturation on this image seems to be slightly weak... I''m not sure if you can, but a polarizer would work well on this shot... good work :) = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'very nice candid.. the composition is also excellent... The color saturation on this image seems to be slightly weak... I''m not sure if you can, but a polarizer would work well on this shot... good work :) = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-09-06 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114984, 5144, 811, '<td valign="top">I think it needs a little more foreground, and a little less at teh top, but that is just me.  Great capture (focus,etc.). karmat</td>', 'I think it needs a little more foreground, and a little less at teh top, but that is just me.  Great capture (focus,etc.). karmat', '2002-09-06 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114985, 5144, 1005, '<td valign="top">Fine shot.  The only thing that really bothers me about this shot is the boat''s gunnels, it seems choppy (it might be from the reflection off the water?)  A little more contrast for the upper ends of the fishing rods might have been nice, but that seems like I''m asking too much.  8 Swash</td>', 'Fine shot.  The only thing that really bothers me about this shot is the boat''s gunnels, it seems choppy (it might be from the reflection off the water?)  A little more contrast for the upper ends of the fishing rods might have been nice, but that seems like I''m asking too much.  8 Swash', '2002-09-06 20:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114986, 5144, 2437, '<td valign="top">what a sharp picture... these are Japanese guys, right?...</td>', 'what a sharp picture... these are Japanese guys, right?...', '2002-09-07 09:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114987, 5145, 1877, '<td valign="top">this is a very well done photo in my opinion.. the contrast is good. B&amp;W a good choice, otherwise too many colors would distract..  the man having his back to the camera is a small thing that bugs, only because his shirt is so bright it kinda takes you from the rest of the photo.. but i like it. Good job, 8</td>', 'this is a very well done photo in my opinion.. the contrast is good. B&W a good choice, otherwise too many colors would distract..  the man having his back to the camera is a small thing that bugs, only because his shirt is so bright it kinda takes you from the rest of the photo.. but i like it. Good job, 8', '2002-09-02 02:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(114988, 5145, 51167, '<td valign="top">It looks like he is trying to dodge the camera a little.  I think this would have been a hard picture to take and you''ve done it good.  I''d think that a bar is a low light place but you''ve done good at keeping the blur down.</td>', 'It looks like he is trying to dodge the camera a little.  I think this would have been a hard picture to take and you''ve done it good.  I''d think that a bar is a low light place but you''ve done good at keeping the blur down.', '2002-09-02 02:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
