(115076, 5156, 2221, '<td valign="top">Quite satirical ;-) I like it very much. I think the car element is good. It is a good contrast of speed vs. slowness and it only intensifies the slowness of the old man. The motion blur is good (makes the car look speedy). -stephan</td>', 'Quite satirical ;-) I like it very much. I think the car element is good. It is a good contrast of speed vs. slowness and it only intensifies the slowness of the old man. The motion blur is good (makes the car look speedy). -stephan', '2002-09-07 23:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
