 The shot itself is of a very high standard, the composition and exposure are superb and the use of B&amp;W is out of this world.  This shot is unfaultable.  But I think the challenge link is perhaps a little weak, having said that, there''s a fine line between posed and not posed (9)  Great shot, good luck</td>', 'Fantastic portrait The shot itself is of a very high standard, the composition and exposure are superb and the use of B&W is out of this world.  This shot is unfaultable.  But I think the challenge link is perhaps a little weak, having said that, there''s a fine line between posed and not posed (9)  Great shot, good luck', '2002-09-04 08:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
