(115580, 5192, 387, '<td valign="top">Here''s the story behind the pic. My grandson and I got on the Scrambler and I held the camera at arms length and snapped about 5 shots, hoping the composition would be right. This shot is one of them. Thanks for all the kind words and encouragement.</td>', 'Here''s the story behind the pic. My grandson and I got on the Scrambler and I held the camera at arms length and snapped about 5 shots, hoping the composition would be right. This shot is one of them. Thanks for all the kind words and encouragement.', '2002-09-18 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(115581, 5193, 1, '<td valign="top">Everybody''s gonna complain that it''s too dark, as they usually do.  But it''s very well done.  If you''d gotten a lower angle of the couple, I would''ve given you a 10.</td>', 'Everybody''s gonna complain that it''s too dark, as they usually do.  But it''s very well done.  If you''d gotten a lower angle of the couple, I would''ve given you a 10.', '2002-09-02 01:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
