(115583, 5193, 3102, '<td valign="top">This would have been great had the couple been a little more distinguished from the background.  It takes a bit of effort to recognize that this is more than a blurry photo of the Eiffel Tower.  Since their position isn''t against something that gives enough contrast to make them out very well, it may have been cool to try a shot with a flash and a slower exposure to bring out a similar effect with the tower in the background while offering details of the couple.</td>', 'This would have been great had the couple been a little more distinguished from the background.  It takes a bit of effort to recognize that this is more than a blurry photo of the Eiffel Tower.  Since their position isn''t against something that gives enough contrast to make them out very well, it may have been cool to try a shot with a flash and a slower exposure to bring out a similar effect with the tower in the background while offering details of the couple.', '2002-09-02 02:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
