(115920, 5223, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot... the color and the capture of the action are both very nice!  I love the seagulls, but there are not many that are this friendly where i live (5 hours inland :)  I like to feed them when I''m at the beach though.. They are quite friendly and quite hungry most of the time.  We used to ride the ferry between Ft. Fisher and Southport, NC each summer.  We would load up on bread for this trip because the seagulls would follow the boat and take bits of bread from our hands.  As a child, this was quite an experience :)  Good shot... = 10 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a great shot... the color and the capture of the action are both very nice!  I love the seagulls, but there are not many that are this friendly where i live (5 hours inland :)  I like to feed them when I''m at the beach though.. They are quite friendly and quite hungry most of the time.  We used to ride the ferry between Ft. Fisher and Southport, NC each summer.  We would load up on bread for this trip because the seagulls would follow the boat and take bits of bread from our hands.  As a child, this was quite an experience :)  Good shot... = 10 - jmsetzler', '2002-09-03 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
