(115948, 5225, 2003, '<td valign="top">tried to get some pics at the JITB drive-thru, but the headlights kept washing out the whole shot - so i hunted for some people smoking outside bars, but they looked like they''d beat me up - as i drove back past the JITB, i noticed that some people inside were visible, so i parked across the street and shot in between the passing cars --- this guy seemed to be enjoying his food, and i got lucky with the hand-to-mouth action ---- i sure thought this would score higher :(</td>', 'tried to get some pics at the JITB drive-thru, but the headlights kept washing out the whole shot - so i hunted for some people smoking outside bars, but they looked like they''d beat me up - as i drove back past the JITB, i noticed that some people inside were visible, so i parked across the street and shot in between the passing cars --- this guy seemed to be enjoying his food, and i got lucky with the hand-to-mouth action ---- i sure thought this would score higher :(', '2002-09-09 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 0),
