(116173, 5241, 3469, '<td valign="top">What is Anthony staring at and what is he staring from (what does the prominent background mean?). Composition-wise this picture is OK, but as a viewer it leaves me highly dissatisfied. It is candid, OK, but so what? The image-culture used is not universal, therefore I have the feeling that this picture is speaking only to the knowing (USA?), leaving 99% or so of the World''s population in the dark. That is OK if you want to address the 1%, but I happen to belong to the other 99%.</td>', 'What is Anthony staring at and what is he staring from (what does the prominent background mean?). Composition-wise this picture is OK, but as a viewer it leaves me highly dissatisfied. It is candid, OK, but so what? The image-culture used is not universal, therefore I have the feeling that this picture is speaking only to the knowing (USA?), leaving 99% or so of the World''s population in the dark. That is OK if you want to address the 1%, but I happen to belong to the other 99%.', '2002-09-02 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
