(116231, 5243, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wow! I really like this image. Is this girl in trouble? Or just on here way somewhere and had to sit down and fix her shoe? She looks well dressed but she''s sitting on an old-fashioned suitcase. The neighborhood looks desolate. Just can''t tell. This would have been so tempting to do in b &amp; w but you did the right thing.</td>', 'Wow! I really like this image. Is this girl in trouble? Or just on here way somewhere and had to sit down and fix her shoe? She looks well dressed but she''s sitting on an old-fashioned suitcase. The neighborhood looks desolate. Just can''t tell. This would have been so tempting to do in b & w but you did the right thing.', '2002-09-04 12:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
