(116233, 5243, 3105, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo.  With this subject I would say the overexposure works and doesn''t really detract from the image.  Good framing and placement of the woman within the frame (the parking meter fits right in there).  I hope more people notice this too, but the Lucky Charms box is the perfect accent to this photo and the perfect thing to have next to her (for the photo''s purposes).  The Lucky Charms box seems to be there to mock her "unluckiness".  Great job.<br/>Score: 9<br/>Courtenay</td>', 'This is a good photo.  With this subject I would say the overexposure works and doesn''t really detract from the image.  Good framing and placement of the woman within the frame (the parking meter fits right in there).  I hope more people notice this too, but the Lucky Charms box is the perfect accent to this photo and the perfect thing to have next to her (for the photo''s purposes).  The Lucky Charms box seems to be there to mock her "unluckiness".  Great job.Score: 9Courtenay', '2002-09-04 18:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(116234, 5243, 3565, '<td valign="top">Very emotional image. Memorable.</td>', 'Very emotional image. Memorable.', '2002-09-04 19:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
