(116327, 5249, 3105, '<td valign="top">This is very well done.  I like the framing (not getting the boys'' entire bodies or torso in the frame and having enough of the boarded up passageway visible at the top of the frame) as it helps build the mystery of what is behind the boards.  Having the boy on the right sticking out of the bottom right of the frame also builds more tension as it seems like he is (and me too) straining to see what is there.  Excellent.<br/>Score: 10<br/>Courtenay</td>', 'This is very well done.  I like the framing (not getting the boys'' entire bodies or torso in the frame and having enough of the boarded up passageway visible at the top of the frame) as it helps build the mystery of what is behind the boards.  Having the boy on the right sticking out of the bottom right of the frame also builds more tension as it seems like he is (and me too) straining to see what is there.  Excellent.Score: 10Courtenay', '2002-09-04 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(116328, 5249, 1037, '<td valign="top">That''s very cute! Nicely captured, nicely framed and composed. For some reason I love the way their hair spirals... it''s such a boy thing, makes me want to pat them on the head :). The feeling is of spying on the kids as they spy on someone else, and that if they find out they''re being watched they''ll jump up and act innocent. Nice mood, in other words :)</td>', 'That''s very cute! Nicely captured, nicely framed and composed. For some reason I love the way their hair spirals... it''s such a boy thing, makes me want to pat them on the head :). The feeling is of spying on the kids as they spy on someone else, and that if they find out they''re being watched they''ll jump up and act innocent. Nice mood, in other words :)', '2002-09-04 15:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
