(116490, 5255, 806, '<td valign="top">Cool! Was hoping for top 10! Thanks everyone!<br/>Yes, I actually tried to flip this horizontally so that the motion would go left to right, however, my son''s face and the angle of his bike then looked somehow odd.<br/>Glad I finally learned to pan. Another dpchallenge lesson learned and a technique checked off! ;-)</td>', 'Cool! Was hoping for top 10! Thanks everyone!Yes, I actually tried to flip this horizontally so that the motion would go left to right, however, my son''s face and the angle of his bike then looked somehow odd.Glad I finally learned to pan. Another dpchallenge lesson learned and a technique checked off! ;-)', '2002-09-09 01:51:00.000000', NULL, 0),
