(116493, 5256, 1143, '<td valign="top">I tend to like shots that really have a primary subject in sharp focus and no distracting elements. Environmental portraits can be good at times (there are some very good ones in this challenge), but I think it''s usually good not to include too much of the surroundings because they just distract. I''m sure that you didn''t have much time to take this, and that''s a big problem with candids. In order to make it score high with me you would need a different angle (to the left and down lower would work) &amp; exclude those guys in the background. There are just too many distracting elements in the bg  like that tree right over his head. Also, the focus is a bit too soft. As a snapshot it''s good, but there''s some stiff competition here so the technical aspects are really important  :o)  ~indigo997</td>', 'I tend to like shots that really have a primary subject in sharp focus and no distracting elements. Environmental portraits can be good at times (there are some very good ones in this challenge), but I think it''s usually good not to include too much of the surroundings because they just distract. I''m sure that you didn''t have much time to take this, and that''s a big problem with candids. In order to make it score high with me you would need a different angle (to the left and down lower would work) & exclude those guys in the background. There are just too many distracting elements in the bg  like that tree right over his head. Also, the focus is a bit too soft. As a snapshot it''s good, but there''s some stiff competition here so the technical aspects are really important  :o)  ~indigo997', '2002-09-02 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(116494, 5256, 2752, '<td valign="top"><br/>great composition ..the cement blocks and boy carry you right through the photo to the men</td>', 'great composition ..the cement blocks and boy carry you right through the photo to the men', '2002-09-02 19:49:00.000000', NULL, 1);
 A picture that good needs a good score, but I have to run with my challenge impression foremost (7)</td>', 'I wish this shot wasn''t so good because it creates a dilemma.  It''s an amazing photograph, beautiful in fact.  Composition, exposure and lighting are all superb.  But for me, the challenge link is at best uncertain A picture that good needs a good score, but I have to run with my challenge impression foremost (7)', '2002-09-02 12:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
