(4427358, 5143, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oh, how sweet!  She''s HUGE =:-O  The only pig I''ve "met" was a baby potbellied pig and she was a hoot; housebroken, trotted around after me grunting for treats, squealed in delight when she saw a friend ... if I lived in a rural area that allowed pigs I''d have brought her home in a heartbeat.</td>', 'Oh, how sweet!  She''s HUGE =:-O  The only pig I''ve "met" was a baby potbellied pig and she was a hoot; housebroken, trotted around after me grunting for treats, squealed in delight when she saw a friend ... if I lived in a rural area that allowed pigs I''d have brought her home in a heartbeat.', '2008-01-26 20:53:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4487067, 5305, 63269, '<td valign="top">I''m pretty sure my grandpa has a picture of this same truck... how neat! I think that a different POV and a different composition might help make this photo more interesting. I personally don''t really like how the car is cut off... and the shadow that''s falling across the lower half of the photo is also bothering me. But it certainly is a very interesting subject!</td>', 'I''m pretty sure my grandpa has a picture of this same truck... how neat! I think that a different POV and a different composition might help make this photo more interesting. I personally don''t really like how the car is cut off... and the shadow that''s falling across the lower half of the photo is also bothering me. But it certainly is a very interesting subject!', '2008-02-14 16:22:05.000000', NULL, 0),
