(5575358, 5298, 10374, '<td valign="top">Used as the cover of a book, Reflections on Anthropology.  Here is the URL for the amazon.com image -- it looks much better in person!<br/> <br/>//www.amazon.com/Reflections-Anthropology-Four-Field-Katherine-Dettwyler/dp/0072485981/ref=sr_1_1?ie=UTF8&amp;s=books&amp;qid=1247690975&amp;sr=8-1#reader<br/> <br/>Still love this image.  Writing another book, to be titled "A Fraction of the Feast: Cultural Anthropology and Human Experience."  Looking to see if you had anything appropriate, as I think it would be way cool to use another of your photographs as a book cover.<br/> <br/>Kathy Dettwyler</td>', 'Used as the cover of a book, Reflections on Anthropology.  Here is the URL for the amazon.com image -- it looks much better in person! //www.amazon.com/Reflections-Anthropology-Four-Field-Katherine-Dettwyler/dp/0072485981/ref=sr_1_1?ie=UTF8&s=books&qid=1247690975&sr=8-1#reader Still love this image.  Writing another book, to be titled "A Fraction of the Feast: Cultural Anthropology and Human Experience."  Looking to see if you had anything appropriate, as I think it would be way cool to use another of your photographs as a book cover. Kathy Dettwyler', '2009-07-15 17:51:04.000000', NULL, 0),
